{
  "an8.23:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 8.23 ",
  "an8.23:0.2": "3. Gahapativagga ",
  "an8.23:0.3": "Paṭhamahatthakasutta ",
  "an8.23:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā āḷaviyaṁ viharati aggāḷave cetiye. ",
  "an8.23:1.2": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "an8.23:1.3": "“sattahi, bhikkhave, acchariyehi abbhutehi dhammehi samannāgataṁ hatthakaṁ āḷavakaṁ dhāretha. ",
  "an8.23:1.4": "Katamehi sattahi? ",
  "an8.23:1.5": "Saddho hi, bhikkhave, hatthako āḷavako; ",
  "an8.23:1.6": "sīlavā, bhikkhave, hatthako āḷavako; ",
  "an8.23:1.7": "hirīmā, bhikkhave, hatthako āḷavako; ",
  "an8.23:1.8": "ottappī, bhikkhave, hatthako āḷavako; ",
  "an8.23:1.9": "bahussuto, bhikkhave, hatthako āḷavako; ",
  "an8.23:1.10": "cāgavā, bhikkhave, hatthako āḷavako; ",
  "an8.23:1.11": "paññavā, bhikkhave, hatthako āḷavako—",
  "an8.23:1.12": "imehi kho, bhikkhave, sattahi acchariyehi abbhutehi dhammehi samannāgataṁ hatthakaṁ āḷavakaṁ dhārethā”ti. ",
  "an8.23:1.13": "Idamavoca bhagavā. ",
  "an8.23:1.14": "Idaṁ vatvāna sugato uṭṭhāyāsanā vihāraṁ pāvisi. ",
  "an8.23:2.1": "Atha kho aññataro bhikkhu pubbaṇhasamayaṁ nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya yena hatthakassa āḷavakassa nivesanaṁ tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā paññatte āsane nisīdi. ",
  "an8.23:2.2": "Atha kho hatthako āḷavako yena so bhikkhu tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā taṁ bhikkhuṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinnaṁ kho hatthaka�